DESCRIPTION:Shannon Fiedler is a comedian\, writer and content creator from
  NYC. Known for her relatable — albeit exaggerated — social media chara
 cters\, Shannon distills ordinary situations to their most entertaining ess
 ence. A fan favorite is her “city girls” series\, taking on regional tr
 opes with an over-the-top and unexpected spin\, from the preppy Connecticut
  Girl to the brash Bostonian to the naive Minnesotan. Shannon's has been fe
 atured on various media platforms and accounts\, including BuzzFeed\, Barst
 ool\, Overheard New York\, Betches\, and Gratzia.\n\nManagement reserves th
 e right to prevent customers from entering the facility who they deem disru
 ptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/co
